      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been noticing something weird lately. whenever i'm near heavy electrical equipment or even just in certain parts of the city, i feel this massive sense of brain fog and lethargy. i've been doing some reading and it seems like the standard 440hz tuning and grid frequencies might actually be tuned to keep people in a low-vibration, submissive state. is there any actual evidence for the government using specific frequency modulation in the power grid for social control or mood regulation?",
